# Benchmark Standard

Every benchmark must record:

- baseline implementation;
- exact version;
- configuration;
- hardware;
- software environment;
- dataset version;
- random seed;
- metric definition;
- timeout;
- retry policy;
- failure treatment;
- total cost;
- statistical uncertainty;
- reproducibility status.

